## Plan

Add an `sms` queue consumed by a worker, and let `markShipped` enqueue a job. The worker enforces compliance instead of the caller, so every path (dashboard batch, retries, future channels) is covered.

**`src/queues.ts`** — add:
```ts
export const smsQueue = new Queue("sms", { connection });
```

**`src/orders/ship.ts`** — after the email job:
```ts
if (order.buyer.phone && order.buyer.phoneVerified) {
  await smsQueue.add("shipped", {
    orderId: order.id,
    to: order.buyer.phone,
    trackingUrl,
    locale: order.buyer.locale,
    timezone: order.buyer.timezone,
  }, { jobId: `shipped-sms-${order.id}` }); // idempotent on retry
